#!/usr/bin/env briar
# Statica c

An `interior` (static) helper and variable with the same names as
`statica_b`'s: private to each file, so the build (and the amalgam) is
fine.

<c!>
interior s32 basis = III;

interior s32
adiutor (vacuum)
{
    redde basis;
}

s32
statica_c_valor (vacuum)
{
    redde adiutor();
}
</c>
